- [38;5;10mignore[0m is consulted only when [38;5;10mstate == 0[0m, never mid-byte, and classification is checked before [38;5;10mignore[0m, so an [38;5;10mignore[0m set overlapping the hex alphabet has no effect. Both are covered directly.[0m[0m
